WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:03.633
- Hi, I'm Sherry Pie and I'm
at Buzzfeed's Queer Prom.

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:05.303
This is my first prom.

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:07.443
(cheers)

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:21.540
- For me being here for Queer Prom

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:25.570
feels like a well-deserved
break, like I'm officially done

00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:28.080
with high school and ready for whatever

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:30.963
the world throws at me
and that's exciting.

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:33.410
- I'm like most excited to see everyone

00:00:33.410 --> 00:00:36.210
being comfortable with
everything that they are wearing.

00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:37.743
- I want to rock a suit.

00:00:37.743 --> 00:00:38.630
I want people to look at me

00:00:38.630 --> 00:00:40.747
and be like, "Dang, she looks good!"

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:41.933
- I want to be seen.

00:00:41.933 --> 00:00:43.610
I want them to look and keep looking

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:46.063
and then not look away, the whole night.

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:48.470
- I want to be like those spotlights.

00:00:48.470 --> 00:00:51.440
I get to do that for once in
my life and it's so cool to me.

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:53.420
I want my hair to be a crazy color

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.620
that no one in that
hall expects me to wear.

00:00:55.630 --> 00:00:59.263
The hair, everyone's positive
vibes, and the makeup,

00:00:59.575 --> 00:01:01.923
Oh man, I felt like royalty.

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:03.560
- To be completely honest, I do love

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:04.910
the attention a little bit.

00:01:05.025 --> 00:01:08.423
Everyone's experimenting
with makeup, with clothing.

00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:11.080
- I like looking like a boss,

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:14.973
I like looking put-together
and, like, ya'll made it happen.

00:01:15.610 --> 00:01:17.460
Oh my god, I think I'm gonna
look like Prince Charming.

00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:19.860
- [Rob] What do you think?
- They look amazing!

00:01:19.960 --> 00:01:21.870
Oh my god, they go with my eyes

00:01:21.870 --> 00:01:25.210
- So you get sparkle, sparkle,
yes, great little suit

00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:26.696
that has the elongated jacket...

00:01:26.696 --> 00:01:29.063
- I get to wear I suit,
I get to wear pants.

00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:30.133
That's awesome.

00:01:30.650 --> 00:01:32.100
- Who wears prints like this?

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:35.860
I got chills as soon as
I put that jumpsuit on.

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:37.000
- I'm excited about that.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:39.023
I can't wait to see all of it.

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:40.663
- We have our look!
- High five!

00:01:41.960 --> 00:01:43.113
- [Camera Person] Take one.

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:47.523
- Hey, oh my gosh!

00:01:47.629 --> 00:01:49.510
I don't feel like at home I can just go

00:01:49.510 --> 00:01:50.733
somewhere in a pink tux.

00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:52.753
- Oh my god, yes.

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:56.380
- Ooh, my hair looks
good, I look flawless!

00:01:56.380 --> 00:01:58.700
- If the rest of my life
is going to be like this

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:01.320
or anywhere close, I am so ready.

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:03.780
- I feel so confident in what
I'm wearing, I feel confident

00:02:03.780 --> 00:02:06.410
in my hair, I feel confident
in my makeup, my clothes.

00:02:06.410 --> 00:02:08.360
I'm wearing something I'm
gonna be comfortable in.

00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:10.673
I can wear pants and can
bust a move, why not?

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:13.563
- I'm so excited to
wear this to Queer Prom!

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:19.700
- I am super particular about the outfits

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:22.500
that I've put together and
I ended up looking exactly

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:23.630
how I wanted to look.

00:02:23.630 --> 00:02:25.520
- Wow, like, this is actually happening!

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:28.450
I get to wear a boutonniere,
I get to wear whatever I want!

00:02:28.450 --> 00:02:29.540
You're gonna see like, the true Eva.

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:31.130
You're gonna get the whole attitude.

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:32.530
- I didn't mind being, like,

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:34.454
extra, extra, read all about it!

00:02:34.454 --> 00:02:36.037
- Let's go to prom!

00:02:37.421 --> 00:02:38.254
- [Donovan Voiceover] It was amazing,

00:02:38.254 --> 00:02:40.130
walking through the
streets dressed up so fancy

00:02:40.130 --> 00:02:41.970
and having everyone staring at us.

00:02:41.970 --> 00:02:44.370
- [Paige Voiceover] We looked
amazing, we looked great.

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:45.940
We just looked like an entourage

00:02:45.940 --> 00:02:47.493
and we were important people.

00:02:51.708 --> 00:02:54.033
- Tens, tens, tens across the board!

00:02:54.947 --> 00:02:57.614
(beating music)

00:02:58.620 --> 00:03:00.160
- Hey, everyone, I'm Jay Manual

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:02.710
and we are here at Buzzfeed's Queer Prom.

00:03:02.710 --> 00:03:04.295
- Welcome to Queer Prom!

00:03:04.295 --> 00:03:05.712
We're so excited!

00:03:07.201 --> 00:03:09.960
- I absolutely did not have
a Queer Prom growing up

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:11.803
but being here is incredible.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:14.300
All joining together on the 1st of June,

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:17.673
Pride Month here in New York
City to celebrate Queer Prom.

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:19.370
- [Ose] When I was on the Red Carpet,

00:03:19.370 --> 00:03:22.750
I felt like I was having
the most fun with my friends

00:03:22.850 --> 00:03:25.193
and that made the
experience ten times better.

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:28.630
- I thought the Samsumg
space was so, so crazy

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:32.003
and we all did the cool Samsung
837 experiences together.

00:03:32.050 --> 00:03:34.550
No matter who you were,
it was absolutely awesome.

00:03:34.660 --> 00:03:35.930
- It was just like paradise,

00:03:35.930 --> 00:03:38.423
it was like the perfect
sanctuary to be in.

00:03:38.550 --> 00:03:40.410
Rainbows everywhere!

00:03:40.410 --> 00:03:42.413
- Everyone knows I'm gay and it's okay!

00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:44.063
Ready to party, let's go!

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:46.180
- [Announcer] Let me
officially welcome you

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:49.263
to Buzzfeed's Queer Prom, let's hear it!

00:03:49.810 --> 00:03:51.960
Let's also give a round of applause

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:54.500
for our beautiful Prom Goers, yes!

00:03:57.296 --> 00:03:59.530
- You can be whoever, dress however,

00:03:59.530 --> 00:04:01.580
do whatever, and everybodies' like, yeah!

00:04:04.740 --> 00:04:07.880
Be as extra as you want to
be because we're all extra.

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:08.823
- So much fun!

00:04:09.485 --> 00:04:12.060
(chill techno beat)

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:14.460
- [Teo Voiceover] I remember
dancing, lots of dancing,

00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:17.313
being very out of breath,
just everybody smiles.

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:19.250
- It was actually the first time

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:21.197
that I danced with my mom, too.

00:04:21.197 --> 00:04:24.260
- He did good, I saw him puttin'
on some dance last night,

00:04:24.260 --> 00:04:27.580
It was like, "That's my, no
that's not my child, no."

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:31.013
- They had never seen me dance before.

00:04:32.070 --> 00:04:34.180
- [Ose Voiceover] She was
out here, she was getting it,

00:04:34.180 --> 00:04:35.713
I had such a good time.

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:42.863
- Um, the Drag Queens was
the highlight of my night.

00:04:43.100 --> 00:04:46.100
I've never seen people so
confident in themselves

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:48.020
and it was so inspiring to see.

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:49.650
Drag Queens make you confident,

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:51.790
Drag Queens make you,
like, ready for everything.

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:53.170
- There was a performance by Starley

00:04:53.170 --> 00:04:55.923
which was absolutely incredible,
I think I love Starley.

00:04:58.309 --> 00:05:00.160
I was definitely in a room full of people

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:02.180
that would respect me and
love me no matter, what.

00:05:02.180 --> 00:05:05.003
- It just you know, I felt
like, loved, I felt appreciated.

00:05:05.271 --> 00:05:06.328
("Love is Love" by Starley)

00:05:06.328 --> 00:05:08.749
♪ And then you went on to say ♪

00:05:08.749 --> 00:05:12.800
♪ "How will I break this
news to your mother" ♪

00:05:12.800 --> 00:05:14.920
- I got to hang out with
a bunch of queer people

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:15.753
that I've never met before

00:05:15.753 --> 00:05:17.550
and they honestly felt like family

00:05:17.740 --> 00:05:21.853
and this thing, which I
will never take off my head.

00:05:22.780 --> 00:05:25.853
- I felt so good, getting
crowned especially by Curly!

00:05:26.020 --> 00:05:27.170
Oh, my god, I love him!

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:30.883
I opened up something I
never thought I could,

00:05:30.900 --> 00:05:34.030
I'm building that stepping
stone for future generations

00:05:34.030 --> 00:05:35.460
to be able to scream out loud:

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:39.620
Yes, I am gay, or queer,
or whatever identify as.

00:05:39.620 --> 00:05:40.780
- [Don Voiceover] Having this experience,

00:05:40.780 --> 00:05:43.500
I realized how much of myself
I've been holding back.

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:45.943
I'm still learning so much about myself,

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:48.040
I'm learning so much about what I can do.

00:05:49.062 --> 00:05:51.390
♪ Love is love ♪

00:05:51.390 --> 00:05:53.210
I don't know, I felt
like I was my full self

00:05:53.210 --> 00:05:55.860
at Queer Prom and I can start trying

00:05:55.860 --> 00:05:58.723
to be my full self in other
places in my life also.

00:05:59.045 --> 00:06:01.628
♪ Love is love ♪

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:04.543
Starley let me sing on the microphone!

00:06:05.320 --> 00:06:06.333
It was awesome!

00:06:06.410 --> 00:06:10.283
It was probably the best night
of my entire life other than,

00:06:10.420 --> 00:06:14.583
you know, when I was born
that was really fun. (laughs)

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:18.760
- I would tell person I was
ten years ago that things

00:06:18.760 --> 00:06:21.530
are gonna get so amazing that
you can't even imagine it,

00:06:21.530 --> 00:06:25.043
like I still can't even
imagine it, so just wait.

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:28.253
- If I could go back in time, I would say,

00:06:28.377 --> 00:06:30.637
"Eva, why are you hiding?

00:06:30.637 --> 00:06:34.200
"The true you is amazing and
no one wants you to hide that

00:06:34.267 --> 00:06:36.397
"and there are people who are
going to love you for you,

00:06:36.397 --> 00:06:37.847
"so don't change for anyone."

00:06:38.665 --> 00:06:40.470
- I learned that everyone's
has a different book,

00:06:40.470 --> 00:06:43.933
everyone's got a different
story, and no matter how

00:06:44.010 --> 00:06:46.830
you write your story,
you're always supported

00:06:46.940 --> 00:06:50.087
and to have a community that loves you.

00:06:50.310 --> 00:06:52.380
- I would say to queer teens
who are watching this video,

00:06:52.380 --> 00:06:54.880
if you feel alone right
now, I promise you're not.

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:56.660
You can talk to me, you
can reach out to me,

00:06:56.660 --> 00:06:57.853
I will talk to you.

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:00.290
- I just love the fact that

00:07:00.320 --> 00:07:02.630
they were all able to
come there for one night

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:05.893
and just forget about everything
else and have a good time.

00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:08.493
- This was like a home.

00:07:08.620 --> 00:07:10.710
- I'm probably gonna talk about Queer Prom

00:07:10.710 --> 00:07:11.993
for the rest of my life.

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:15.170
- What existed at Prom and in the last

00:07:15.170 --> 00:07:17.750
couple of days needs to
get out into the world.

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:18.893
- I love you guys!

00:07:20.070 --> 00:07:21.470
- See you later, Queer Prom.

00:07:21.560 --> 00:07:23.510
- It's just the start of something new.

00:07:26.315 --> 00:07:29.241
♪ We've got to hold one another ♪

00:07:29.241 --> 00:07:31.681
♪ We've got to hold on real tight ♪

00:07:31.681 --> 00:07:34.161
♪ You know we only have each other ♪

00:07:34.161 --> 00:07:37.279
♪ As long you open up your eyes ♪

00:07:37.279 --> 00:07:42.279
♪ 'Cause love is love, oh ♪
♪ 'Cause love is love... ♪

